=== KEY INSIGHTS SUMMARY ===
1. SMS has the highest yield (22.1 completions per 1% budget share) and highest user value (LTV factor 1.17)
2. Email has the highest efficiency score (73.0) and consistent completion across categories (57-64%)
3. Web/Mobile show moderate performance but dominate feedback surveys (50.8% of web/mobile responses)
4. Social has extremely low completion rates (1-17%) and category robustness is poor
5. Multi-channel users (email + sms) have 4.2x higher lifecycle value than single-channel users
6. Top quartile users contribute 81% of total lifecycle value - retention is critical
